        "Heat coconut milk and water",
        "Add crushed aromatics and turmeric",
        "Bring to boil",
        "Add rice and salt",
        "Reduce heat to low",
        "Cover and cook 20 minutes",
        "Let rest 5 minutes",
        "Fluff with fork",
        "Serve warm"
      ],
      "notes": "Turmeric gives golden color",
      "fun_fact": "Nasi Kuning is served at Indonesian celebrations and is believed to bring good luck",
